Package: passiveownershipdrift
Title: Passive Ownership Drift Strategy — v1 Backtest
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("MB SMIF", role = c("aut","cre"), email = "smif@example.com")
Description: A long-only S&P 500 strategy that buys stocks experiencing
    confirmed positive fundamental news where passive ownership is
    structurally elevated, with a regime overlay that de-risks the same
    exposure during stress phases.
